\n- ${u}_{1}=\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{3}^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- ${u}_{2}=\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{4}^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3\\sqrt{41}}{41} \\\\ -\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41} \\\\ \\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41}\\end{aligned}].$\n\nTherefore, $B={{u}_{1},{u}_{2}}={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{3}{5}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{3\\sqrt{41}}{41} \\\\ -\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41} \\\\ \\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41}\\end{aligned}]}$ is an orthonormal basis of $V.$\n\nFinally, $a=-\\frac{3\\sqrt{41}}{41},$ $b=-\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41},$ $c=\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41}$ and  \n\n$$\n|a|+|b|+|c|=|-\\frac{3\\sqrt{41}}{41}|+|-\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41}|+|\\frac{4\\sqrt{41}}{41}|=\\frac{11\\sqrt{41}}{41}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351997 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{13}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351997 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351997 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2ed1f367-805e-51b8-972f-815787ea47d3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352978 #edb/ref 1080 "-13" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352978 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352978 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "a5ac3605-0fd4-5df6-9853-a92d4a898200" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353656 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{13}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353656 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353656 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "effea68f-2892-53fe-93d5-5e13785f636d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353659 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{13}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353659 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353659 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f0448b58-c033-592d-91f7-d47664767da5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186353721 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\fra